## 🚀 This Repo = Live Website
This repo hosts NesbitsFixIt.com on GitHub Pages. Single `index.html` static file — no build, loads fast on phones.

### Required files in root:
- `index.html` — CLEAN static site (NOT the React artifact iframe file)
- `CNAME` — contains `NesbitsFixit.com`
- `README.md` — this file
- `LICENSE` — MIT for code, brand reserved
- `.gitignore` — ignore OS files
- `nesbits_logo_sides_tilted.png` — master logo
- `qr-call.png` — scan-to-call QR
- `gallery/handyman_headshot_portrait.webp` — owner photo

### GitHub Pages Setup:
1. Settings → Pages → Deploy from branch: main / root
2. Custom domain: NesbitsFixit.com → Save (creates CNAME)
3. DNS at registrar: 4 A records @ → 185.199.108.153, .109, .110, .111 + CNAME www → lloydnesbit699-cyber.github.io
4. Wait for DNS check → Enforce HTTPS

### Why your first commit broke:
You committed the React Artifact wrapper file that starts with `<iframe title="Shared artifact">` and `$RB=[];$RV=function(a)` — that's a preview container, not the real site. It shows `PNG` garbage when opened as text. Replace it with CLEAN_index.html.

